Dialogue: 8,0:20:37.92,0:20:40.07,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,大家将憋在心里的话
Dialogue: 8,0:20:40.07,0:20:41.98,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,通过歌声宣泄了出来
Dialogue: 8,0:20:41.98,0:20:43.07,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,太美好了
Dialogue: 8,0:20:43.07,0:20:44.40,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我感受到了心灵被洗涤
Dialogue: 8,0:20:44.40,0:20:46.93,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,这是何等灵魂的解放
Dialogue: 8,0:20:48.60,0:20:51.23,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,但这对人类来说太早了
Dialogue: 8,0:20:51.56,0:20:53.18,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fnFZZhunYuan-M02\fs55\bord3\fax-0.2\an8\pos(960,10)}我们生而自由
Dialogue: 8,0:20:51.89,0:20:55.25,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,天使啊这对人间来说太刺激了
Dialogue: 8,0:20:53.18,0:20:54.27,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fnFZZhunYuan-M02\fs55\bord3\fax-0.2\an8\pos(960,10)}想得自由
Dialogue: 8,0:20:54.27,0:20:56.08,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fnFZZhunYuan-M02\fs55\bord3\fax-0.2\an8\pos(960,10)}倒掉脑子里的垃圾
Dialogue: 8,0:20:55.25,0:20:56.93,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,这是禁忌之果啊
Dialogue: 8,0:20:56.08,0:20:57.49,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,{\fnFZZhunYuan-M02\fs55\bord3\fax-0.2\an8\pos(960,10)}一旦排空
