Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:08.78,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,Panty & Stocking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:10.24,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,Pa Pa Panty STOCKING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:13.45,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,P-A-N-T-Y-S-T-O-C-K-I-N-G
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.45,0:00:15.23,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,We're the baddest, no fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:16.54,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,let the ghosts appear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:18.00,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,Lock and load, baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.58,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,we takin' the lead here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.58,0:00:22.38,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,Panty n Stocking, Panty n Stocking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:24.13,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,(We) Wreck this system,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:25.38,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,our power is extreme
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:28.09,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,P-A-N-T-Y-S-T-O-C-K-I-N-G
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.09,0:00:29.27,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,Panty & Stocking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.27,0:00:29.79,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,New!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.45,0:00:15.23,OP_CHS,,0,0,0,,飞扬跋扈 无所畏惧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:16.54,OP_CHS,,0,0,0,,恶灵尽管肆虐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:18.00,OP_CHS,,0,0,0,,上膛完毕 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.58,OP_CHS,,0,0,0,,我们将主宰全场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:24.13,OP_CHS,,0,0,0,,掀翻规则
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.13,0:00:25.38,OP_CHS,,0,0,0,,我们力量爆表
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.32,0:22:30.66,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I woke up again with the same regret
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.66,0:22:35.21,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Jump into this mess no exit yet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.21,0:22:38.34,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Every choice I make it falls apart
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.34,0:22:42.01,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But that’s the beat the groove is in my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.01,0:22:45.68,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Pathetic I wear it like a crown
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.68,0:22:48.30,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I crash I burn I laugh out loud
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.30,0:22:49.85,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,yeah yeah yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.85,0:22:52.89,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I’m reckless yeah I know it’s true
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.89,0:22:57.61,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But it’s the madness that gets me through
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.61,0:23:00.73,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,A hopeless anthem just for me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.73,0:23:04.74,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I find my song yeah yeah yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.74,0:23:06.70,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,They think they know me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.70,0:23:08.57,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But that’s the old me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.57,0:23:10.62,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Used to control me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.62,0:23:13.20,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But now they moldy… yup
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.20,0:23:14.62,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,Committed and I did it and you label me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.62,0:23:16.71,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,a menace and a villain cause you can’t get with it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.71,0:23:18.63,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,hate my presence hate my business
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.63,0:23:20.50,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,got no feelings… good riddance
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.50,0:23:24.17,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I’m reckless yeah I know it’s true
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.17,0:23:28.84,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,But it’s the madness that gets me through
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.84,0:23:31.97,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,A hopeless anthem just for me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.97,0:23:36.64,ED_EN,,0,0,0,,I find my song yeah yeah yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.32,0:22:30.66,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我带着相同悔恨醒来
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.66,0:22:35.21,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,纵身跃进这仍无出口的混乱中
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.21,0:22:38.34,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,每个选择都让一切崩坏
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.34,0:22:42.01,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,但这节拍扎根 律动在我血脉
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.01,0:22:45.68,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,可悲啊 我仍引以为傲
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.68,0:22:48.30,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我崩溃我燃烧我大笑
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.30,0:22:49.85,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,耶！耶！耶！
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.85,0:22:52.89,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我自知鲁莽
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.89,0:22:57.61,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,但唯有疯狂 让我活下来
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.61,0:23:00.73,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,一曲绝望颂 只为我存在
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.73,0:23:04.74,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我找到了我的歌
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.74,0:23:06.70,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,他们自以为懂我
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.70,0:23:08.57,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,但那已是过去的我
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.57,0:23:10.62,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,习惯控制我
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.62,0:23:13.20,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,早成过期货…呵
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.20,0:23:14.62,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我做到了 你还在贴标签
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.62,0:23:16.71,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,视我为威胁 说我是恶棍 因为你接不住招
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.71,0:23:18.63,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,憎恨我的存在 诋毁我的行为
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.63,0:23:20.50,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,无所谓…好走不送
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.50,0:23:24.17,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我自知鲁莽
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.17,0:23:28.84,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,但唯有疯狂 让我活下来
Dialogue: 1,0:23:28.84,0:23:31.97,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,一曲绝望颂 只为我存在
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.97,0:23:36.64,ED_CH,,0,0,0,,我找到了我的歌
